MESSAGE - LEAVE A NOTE FOR THE SYSOP

CALLER. Subject to current caller access policy.

A - Leave a note for the sysop

:A
LEAVE A NOTE FOR THE SYSOP

    MESSAGE

Enter a note at the prompts and save it when finished. This facility
sends a direct submission to the sysop's private host review inbox.
It does not require an RBBS account and is independent of private mail.

Use it for questions, problem reports and notes accompanying uploads.
Include the filename, command, mounted volume and other details needed
to understand your report. A saved note survives logoff; an unsaved
draft is discarded at call recovery.

If you wish to speak live with the sysop, try CHAT. For messages to
registered board users, use RBBS and its PERSONAL forum.

See HELP CHAT, HELP RBBS and HELP UPLOAD.
